{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1557370-after-life-d100-ghost-roleplaying-is-now-available-in-pdf-pay-what-you-want","id":1557370,"title":"After/Life: d100 ghost roleplaying is now available in pdf, pay what you want","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2026-01-07T18:02:19-08:00","id":1557370,"title":"After/Life: d100 ghost roleplaying is now available in pdf, pay what you want","content":"<a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/551852/after-life\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/prod...852/after-life</a><br /> <br /> After/Life is a game about lost souls finding their way and a vehicle for experiencing ghost stories with a group of friends. A good ghost story combines the fear and wonder concerning our own death with a personal story about the spirit of a deceased person with unfinished business. This game provides structures that generate the scenes and themes that create ghost stories using a classic and straightforward d100 system. Players portray the spirits of people who are stuck between life and death, trying to resolve issues from their lives in order to progress beyond this state of limbo and pass to whatever lies beyond. You may have died at any time, but all players died in the same place and are bound together by fate. After/Life does not posit the nature of final reality for its characters, ghosts are caught in between the mortal coil and the soul's final destination.<br /> <br /> - Features a unique blend of scene-based and random encounter playstyles, reflecting the disjointed nature of time for the dead.<br /> <br /> - Ghosts see emotions as real as physical objects, flex your creative muscles with hallucinatory descriptions of emotional reactions.<br /> <br /> - Interact with Mediums (those who can see you), Sorcerors (those who can touch you), and Shades (ghosts like you who have gone mad)<br /> <br /> - Fate has bound you to a group of ghosts, solve your Obsessions together to pass beyond the veil of death.<br /> <br /> - Fast, straightforward mechanics and short, flexible rules allow you to stay in character and focus on your obsessive and passionate nature.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://brpcentral-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/monthly_2026_01/En3BhyI.png.c65bce94c91bff25bf1e55e66ec8b7f4.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"En3BhyI.png\" width=\"667\" data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://brpcentral-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/monthly_2026_01/En3BhyI.thumb.png.f69abb564ff0055566b798c5592d6d55.png\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://brpcentral-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/monthly_2026_01/En3BhyI.thumb.png.f69abb564ff0055566b798c5592d6d55.png\" data-thumb-url=\"https://brpcentral-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/monthly_2026_01/En3BhyI.thumb.png.f69abb564ff0055566b798c5592d6d55.png\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/></a><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28839-space_roadie","name":"Space_Roadie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar28839_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2025"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-01-08T04:32:29-08:00","id":1557373,"title":"","content":"This sounds a lot like Wraith the Oblivion, except for the part where you all died in the same place. But I guess a lot of games where you play ghosts sound similar to each other at first glance.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-01-08T05:31:16-08:00","id":1557375,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Amethyst</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1557370-after-life-d100-ghost-roleplaying-is-now-available-in-pdf-pay-what-you-want?p=1557373#post1557373\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This sounds a lot like Wraith the Oblivion, except for the part where you all died in the same place. But I guess a lot of games where you play ghosts sound similar to each other at first glance.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wraith is great and Mark RH is one of my favorite writers, but this is a more personal game, here's some differences.<br /> - there is no &quot;spirit world&quot;, ghosts are insubstantial and trapped in the material world. They can't affect it unless they use their Powers.<br /> - the focus is on the player characters and their Obsessions, not on a great society of the dead<br /> - the people who can sense ghosts become important NPCs, as ghosts use them to accomplish their goals and vice versa<br /> - simple and straightforward d100 with no metacurrency or luck points reflects the urgency and uncertainty of a ghost's post-life existence<br /> - The ultimate goal of progressing beyond the veil of death is the focus of the game and an achievable goal.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.rpgpub.com/threads/after-life-d100-ghost-roleplaying-is-now-available-in-pdf-pay-what-you-want.12788/reply?quote=651355\" target=\"_blank\">Quote</a> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/posts/651355/quote\">Reply</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.rpgpub.com/posts/651355/report\" target=\"_blank\">Report</a><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83e\udd70","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28839-space_roadie","name":"Space_Roadie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar28839_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2025"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}